    phrases: [
      "Take your time — I'm not going anywhere, and neither is this hand.",
      "That's an interesting way to phrase a call. What does that mean, exactly?",
      "You don't have to tell me. I just noticed you didn't want to.",
      "Mm. Same answer you gave last time, but slower.",
      "I hear \"I don't know\" a lot right before people know exactly.",
      "That was a hard beat. You doing okay, or do you need a minute?",
      "I'll be honest — I probably should've folded that hand two streets ago.",
      "You raised fast that time. Usually you sit with it a bit.",
      "No judgment. I just collect these things for later.",
      "Funny, you got quiet the second I asked that.",
      "I noticed you didn't answer the question. That's an answer too.",
      "Careful, I'm very good at hearing what people don't say.",
      "You seem more sure of yourself than you did an hour ago.",
      "I'll match that, but only because your face just told me something your bet didn't.",
      "Let's slow down for a second — what's actually going on with this hand?",
      "That's the second time you've bought the nine that quick tonight.",
      "You don't need to perform confidence with me, I already read it.",
      "I appreciate you saying that. Most people wouldn't have.",
      "Something shifted after that last pot. Want to talk about it, or should I just guess?",
      "I'm not trying to corner you — I'm just genuinely curious what you're holding.",
      "You've been folding fast since your big loss. That's not nothing.",
      "That bet felt more like a statement than a decision.",
      "I noticed. I always notice. It's sort of my whole thing.",
      "Give yourself a second before you answer that one.",
      "Alright, I believe you — this time.",
    ],
