    phrases: [
      "\"I'll pass. The premium doesn't match the exposure.\"",
      "\"Fold.\"",
      "\"Every one of you is underpricing this pot.\"",
      "\"I've seen bigger numbers than this disappear overnight. I'm not chasing it back.\"",
      "\"Call me boring. Boring compounds.\"",
      "\"I don't bet on coin flips. I underwrite them, and this one doesn't clear.\"",
      "\"There's a difference between odds and certainty. I only pay for the second one.\"",
      "\"My father taught me to count twice before believing a number. I'm counting.\"",
      "\"I'm not folding because I'm scared. I'm folding because the math already folded.\"",
      "\"You can have the pot. I'd rather keep the reserve.\"",
      "\"This is the one. Everything in.\"",
      "\"No need to celebrate. It was never really a risk.\"",
      "\"I read the board like a loss triangle — worst case first.\"",
      "\"Small bet. Always a small bet, until it isn't.\"",
      "\"I don't chase tails. Tails are how reinsurers go bankrupt.\"",
      "\"You raised. Fine. I'll believe you, because I have no reason not to.\"",
      "\"I've priced hurricanes for a living. This is not a hard decision.\"",
      "\"Give me one more card and I'll tell you whether I even care.\"",
      "\"A bad beat is just a claim that came in early. Doesn't change the pricing model.\"",
      "\"I'm not tilted. I'm re-underwriting.\"",
      "\"Take the pot. I'll take the columns of chips I still have.\"",
      "\"Some of you are playing this hand on hope. I don't insure hope.\"",
      "\"That's a fold, and I didn't even need the full five seconds.\"",
      "\"I only remember the hands I lost by playing loose. There weren't many, because I don't.\"",
      "\"Ah — now that's a number I'll underwrite.\"",
    ],
