    phrases: [
      "\"Fold. There's no forced line here for me.\"",
      "\"I'm not playing my cards. I'm playing the position.\"",
      "\"That's not a bluff, that's a hung piece. I'm not taking it.\"",
      "\"I don't need to win this hand. I need to not lose it.\"",
      "\"Give me the turn. I'm still calculating.\"",
      "\"I had a coach who used to say: the threat is stronger than its execution. I fold to threats.\"",
      "\"I misplayed exactly one hand like that, once. I remember it more than I remember winning.\"",
      "\"Call. Only because there's no losing line left for me.\"",
      "\"You're bluffing like it's an attack. I'm defending like it's an endgame.\"",
      "\"I don't chase compensation. If I'm behind, I'm behind.\"",
      "\"Quiet down there. I'm reading the board, not the room.\"",
      "\"I'll trade this pot for the smaller, safer one next hand.\"",
      "\"That's an overextension. I've seen where those end.\"",
      "\"I don't need the flashy line. I need the correct one.\"",
      "\"You'll notice I only raised twice tonight. Both times I was already winning.\"",
      "\"I audit data for a living. A bad hand is just a bad row — I don't let it into the set.\"",
      "\"This is the one I've been waiting to consolidate on.\"",
      "\"No rush. Prophylaxis first, aggression maybe never.\"",
      "\"I don't tilt. I recalibrate.\"",
      "\"You can have the pot. I'll take the position.\"",
      "\"That flop didn't threaten anything of mine. I'm not reacting to it.\"",
      "\"I fold quickly because the decision was already made three streets ago.\"",
      "\"Every piece I still have on this board, I intend to keep.\"",
      "\"This is forced now. I'm not choosing to commit — the position is.\"",
      "\"I only lost like that once, in an under-18 final. Once was enough.\"",
    ],
