      "Running it back. Same spot, bigger number.",
      "I had the read. The read was correct. The card just didn't respect the read.",
      "Two outs. TWO. On the last card. Do you understand how rare that is.",
      "No take-backs on this one, but I want it on record that it was close.",
      "I'll see this one too.",
      "That fold wasn't standard. Don't act like it was standard.",
      "Recalibrating. Give me one hand.",
      "In the sim, I win that ninety-something percent of the time. We are not in the sim tonight, apparently.",
      "I don't tilt. I recompute. Loudly, sometimes.",
      "Checked. Moving on.",
      "That's twice the wrong card landed exactly where it shouldn't have. I'm allowed to notice a pattern.",
      "See — that's what correct play looks like when the deck cooperates.",
      "One decision, no do-over. I know. I'm taking it anyway.",
